  "body_html": "<p>At Jeminise, we understand the passion for sports, and this Softball themed comforter set is designed for every softball player and fan. Transform your bedroom into a vibrant haven with this bright teal and yellow decorative comforter set, offering both style and comfort.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Meaningful Theme:</strong> Designed specifically for softball players, fans, and lovers, celebrating the spirit of the game.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Offered in Twin (68\"x90\"), Full (79\"x90\"), Queen (90x90\"), and King (104\"x90\") to fit various bed sizes.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Superior Manufacturing:</strong> Features environmental protection dyeing techniques to prevent fading and ensures smooth, fine, and compact stitching for lasting enjoyment.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Soft &amp; Durable Material:</strong> Made from 100% brushed microfiber polyester (360 gsm) for an ultra-soft, smooth, and durable feel that is fade-resistant, cool, and breathable.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable and dries quickly; tumble dry low. For best results, wash in a mesh laundry bag.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Included Components:</strong> This set includes one comforter, offering a complete bedding solution.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Product Style:</strong> Features a dynamic Sport theme with a vibrant Softball Design 05, adding a refreshing touch to any room.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Comforter Set</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>70% Cotton, 30% Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Color</th>\n<td>Softball Design 05</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Style</th>\n<td>Sport</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Sport</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Basketball Player</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Included Components</th>\n<td>Comforter</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>2 text inputs</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>Twin 68\"x90\"(173cm*218cm), Full 79\"x90\"(200cm*230cm), Queen 90x90\"(228cm*228cm), King 104\"x90\"(228cm*264cm)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Size</th>\n<td>Twin/Full/Queen/King</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Special Feature</th>\n<td>Durable, Fade Resistant</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Seasons</th>\n<td>Fall, Spring, Summer</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
